4.Methodology: Policy of Thoughts (PoT)
In this section, we present thePolicy of Thoughts (PoT)framework. We first formalize the reasoning process as an online adaptation problem, followed by an overview of the evolutionary cycle. We then detail the mechanisms of exploratory conjecture and policy (see Figure3).
