The model is fine-tuned using Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO). For each input prompt, we sample a group of G= 3outputs to estimate the advantage function through relative reward ranking, thereby eliminating the need for a separate value network.
The training objective incorporates a KL divergence penalty with a coefficient β= 0.02to ensure
